<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile offers 1 million pounds of cobalt.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile offers 1 million pounds of cobalt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it released invitations for bids for approximately 1 million pounds of cobalt under the sealed bid format.</p>
<p>Bids for this material must be received by 1300 EST on March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>A second offering under the invitation is planned for May 1997.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
